# Push Buyer Tracker updates

After you change this codebase, commit the update and push it to https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/Buyer-Tracker.git.

- Remote: `origin` → `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/Buyer-Tracker.git`
- Push the current branch. Do not force-push.
- Never commit `data/`, `.venv/`, `tracker.db`, `.env`, or any Etherscan API key. Keys stay in the local SQLite database only.
- Do not change git config. Do not skip hooks.
- If the push fails, say so and leave the commit in place.
